OL,3,GNEWSATigers great inducted into club's
OL,4,AHall of Fame
OL,5,
OL,6,FHull City have inducted the late John
OL,7,F"Jacky" Smith into their Hall of Fame.
OL,9,FSmith, who signed from Hebburn Argyle
OL,10,Fin 1905, quickly established himself as
OL,11,Fone of the club's greatest goal
OL,12,Fscorers.
OL,14,FHe becomes the 15th player to receive
OL,15,Fthe honour, joining a list of club
OL,16,Flegends, including Dean Windass, Chris
OL,17,FChilton and Ken Wagstaff.
OL,19,FA club spokesperson said they were
OL,20,Fdelighted to recognise the player's
OL,21,Fcontribution.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
